    "title": "What Time Will 'The Boys' Season 5 Be on Prime Video? Where To Watch New Episodes of 'The Boys' For Free",
    "text": "Published April 7, 2026, 3:30 p.m. ET 0 seconds of 2 minutes, 41 secondsVolume 0% We’ve finally arrived at the beginning of the end as the fifth and final season of The Boys debuts on Prime Video. Are we prepared to say goodbye to Butcher (Karl Urban), Hughie (Jack Quaid), and the rest of our favorite group of lovably deranged Supe hunters? No. Not at all. But only eight episodes remain as our heroes attempt to topple the increasingly dangerous Homelander (Antony Starr). The official Season 5 synopsis teases that it’s “Homelander’s world, completely subject to his erratic, egomaniacal whims.” Per Amazon, “Hughie, Mother’s Milk, and Frenchie are imprisoned in a ‘Freedom Camp,’ while Annie struggles to mount a resistance against the overwhelming Supe force. Kimiko is nowhere to be found. But when Butcher reappears, ready and willing to use a virus that will wipe all Supes off the map, he sets in motion a chain of events that will forever change the world and everyone in it.” If you’re in need of a Season 4 recap, Decider’s Radhamely De Leon has you covered. Who’s ready for one last ride?! From start time to free streaming info, here’s how to watch The Boys Season 5 on Prime Video. The Boys Season 5 Release Date: The fifth season of The Boys debuts Wednesday, April 8 on Prime Video. What Time Will The Boys Season 5 Drop On Prime Video? Visit Advertiser websiteGO TO PAGEThe first two episodes drop Wednesday, April 8, at 3:00 a.m. ET (12:00 a.m. PT) on Prime Video. The Boys Season 5 Episode Release Schedule: New episodes of The Boys premiere Wednesday mornings at 3:00 a.m. ET on Prime Video, with the series finale scheduled to drop on May 20. The Boys Season 5, Episode 3: April 15 The Boys Season 5, Episode 4: April 22 The Boys Season 5, Episode 5: April 29 The Boys Season 5, Episode 6: May 6 The Boys Season 5, Episode 7: May 13 The Boys Season 5, Episode 8: May 20 The Boys Season 5 Cast Info: There’ll be a few new faces this season, with Maitreyi Ramakrishnan, Ely Henry, Dylan Colton, and Emma Elle Paterson joining the cast of The Boys. How To Watch The Boys Season 5 Online: New episodes of The Boys will be streaming on Prime Video. Amazon Prime is available for $14.99/month or $139/year. Prime for Young Adults and Prime Access (eligible government assistance recipients or income-verified customers) are also options for $7.49/month and $6.99/month, respectively. Does Prime Video Offer a Free Trial? Yes! Amazon offers a 30-day free trial for new and eligible subscribers. The first two episodes of The Boys Season 5 debut Wednesday, April 8 on Prime Video. Tags karl urban Prime Video The Boys",
